    "name": "belief_probe_method_rerun",
    "_why": "REGENERATES the method's belief_confusion.json, which was destroyed by the job this entry replaces. belief_confusion_probe.py writes to a FIXED path (results/analysis/belief_ceiling/belief_confusion.json) with no --out, so every run overwrites the last. The deleted entry pointed the probe at the Module-1 ablation as a 'control', but that arm has no belief_net at all -- plain MAZero -- so the probe skipped it and wrote an empty {} over the method's data. The numbers survived in v7_module1_evidence.md; this restores the artefact and copies it to a run-specific name so the next probe run cannot repeat the loss.",
